                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Welcome to the Science Festival. Today's main talk, on robots in medicine, will take place in the Blue Hall — not the Red Hall as printed in your programme. It starts at two forty-five. Children's workshops are in the garden tent and are free, but places are limited, so please register at the information desk by noon. The festival closes at six, and the last shuttle bus to the station leaves at six fifteen.”"
